lines=['Hoops Dynasty — Phase 10: Paired roster/transition candidate and late-game tests','21 October 2026','',f'Joint numerical gate: {decision}. '+('The paired candidate qualifies for production; late-game variants remain audit-only.'if r['jointGate']else'Phase 8 remains production. The candidate is retained only as an experiment.'),'','1. Acceptance test','Five independent complete NBA regular seasons, seeds 101–105, 30 teams × 82 games: 6,150 games per arm. Phase 8 is the retained baseline. This is not a five-year longitudinal career. Changed roster allocations and RNG consumption cause subsequent career states to diverge; seed pairing does not mean identical later random draws.','Ranges declared before the acceptance results: mean margin 12.0–13.5; 20+ rate 18–24%; average across-season population SD of team season scoring margins 5.0–6.0 points. All three must pass together. These are practical tolerances around the requested reference, not confidence intervals or newly verified universal standards.','Metric | Phase 8 | Paired candidate | Reference']
